<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="2">

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ALEC"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Mountaintop overlooking noho - Dusk</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec stands, chest out, defiant. He looks out on the skyline of NoHo.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>My city.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You’ve failed me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition">
      <Text>Cut to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHLOE"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. News Footage Montage</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>First channel. Chloe. National news.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Chloe</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>A loose cannon local newscaster went on a profane sixteen-minute rant. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>And yes there was nudity. And yes we have a clip, but I must warn you, what you are about to see is disturbing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ALEC"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. NoHo Studio</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>It’s so god damn old testament how we obsessively consume violence yet everyone gets fucking pissy if I show you... This.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>A pair of boobs appear over Alec’s shoulder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Now, let’s all take a deep breath.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Has anyone died?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHLOE"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Chloe </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Chloe</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Despicable.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Let’s take some calls!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TOM"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Second Chanel. Tom. Late night show.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Tom stands delivering a monologue.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Tom</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Can you believe it?! This will be the first time in NoHo </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold+Underline">history</Text>
      <Text> that the beloved NoHo Rag will sail on without a Reidel at the helm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Crowd sound: Gasp</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Tom (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Now folks, I’m not saying Alec Reidel has squandered his family legacy, but </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold+Underline">somebody</Text>
      <Text> is sitting at his family’s Thanksgiving kiddie table!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Crowd sound: Cheer!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CAITLIN"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Third Chanel. Caitlin. The Burbank vista.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Caitlin leans on a table, sloshing a glass of wine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>CAitlin</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Now, have you heard what passes for news in NoHo?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(sotto)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The city of </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold+Underline">scoundrels</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The crowd erupts and Caitlin </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">shooshes</Text>
      <Text> them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Caitlin (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I know! This, this, this Reidel character thinks he can just go on our </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold+Underline">municipal</Text>
      <Text> airwaves and talk about the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold+Underline">nipples</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. John quincy steamberg - good way sex emporium</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>John stands at the till, dildo on the counter, a wall of sin behind.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>John</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Yeah, I knew that man was a pervert when he interviewed me, the second he mentioned anal beads!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I felt it as he looked upon me with those </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold+Underline">suppressive</Text>
      <Text> eyes...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="3" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHLOE"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GUY"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Chloe - National News</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Chloe</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>My take: The guy is just expressing his first amendment rights.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>A guy is on the phone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Guy (v.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Oh that’s bull-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition">
      <Text>Cut to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="3" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CAITLIN"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. Caitlin</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>CaitLIN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>He scarred thousands of children, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold+Underline">and for what?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="3" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ED"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TOM"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Tom</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Tom</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Hey if I want to see boobs at 7, I’ll watch </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold+Underline">Wheel of Fortune</Text>
      <Text>! </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Cutaway to Ed McMahon</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Ed</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Ha! Yes!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Cut back to Tom enjoying the joke too much.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Cut back to Ed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Ed (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Heyo</Text>
      <Text>!!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition">
      <Text>Cut to:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="3" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ALEC"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. mOUNTAINTOP OVERLOOKING NOHO - No Time Passed</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec erupts.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You bastards!!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>TITLE CARD: NOHO RAG UNDER: Season Two UNDER: Get on the rag this fall!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>TITLE CARD: You’re Welcome</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

